 sản phẩm, hình thức và địa chỉ giao hàng mà có thể phát sinh thêm chi phí khác như phí vận chuyển, phụ phí hàng cồng kềnh, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....</p>","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/23/91/be/3c2f1bc9c80d7b673c144618133266e1.png","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/23/91/be/3c2f1bc9c80d7b673c144618133266e1.png","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/23/91/be/3c2f1bc9c80d7b673c144618133266e1.png","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/23/91/be/3c2f1bc9c80d7b673c144618133266e1.png","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/23/91/be/3c2f1bc9c80d7b673c144618133266e1.png"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/8f/b5/d8/e99c8b48123faa074364d0f1939f2081.png","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/8f/b5/d8/e99c8b48123faa074364d0f1939f2081.png","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/8f/b5/d8/e99c8b48123faa074364d0f1939f2081.png","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/8f/b5/d8/e99c8b48123faa074364d0f1939f2081.png","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/8f/b5/d8/e99c8b48123faa074364d0f1939f2081.png"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/1c/4d/47/1bb575f3d4845e27e502e91cafc8ed6f.png","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/1c/4d/47/1bb575f3d4845e27e502e91cafc8ed6f.png","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/1c/4d/47/1bb575f3d4845e27e502e91cafc8ed6f.png","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/1c/4d/47/1bb575f3d4845e27e502e91cafc8ed6f.png","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/1c/4d/47/1bb575f3d4845e27e502e91cafc8ed6f.png"},{"base_url":"https://s